{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_022_01_c",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:eee9e0f18ab772af0d09672992954b574d0f305bad8a9cb07f6e928c44108132",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_c:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:99a4d540da21e6cd81137945dfaab9dc34d2cd0f57d911689749e0022ae9376d",
      "text": "那么，下一个问题。你有喜欢的人吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_c:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d897a76ec85aec32d5c91b42107177700978eb4dcc89fda6fde4290238f8f4e8",
      "text": "喜欢的人……是旬。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_c:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a5d4f6a680d1458eb3949e3e59dc568c9abfd03ad969215caf5e1b4e7c519469",
      "text": "旬是，我憧憬的人……\n听旬弹钢琴，就会觉得好幸福。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_c:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8948d07bb5677746a7805fdde6ee80ba0f6d5d4b5670e0f996c12ea7332b4177",
      "text": "原、原来如此……\n顺便问一下，除了旬先生以外还有别人吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_c:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9f00b0279a75725d6a8f072dacf39a32d6bb3bb3dc3fd1a769ca10565db34e5c",
      "text": "旬以外……？嗯……\nHigh×Joker的大家，还有家人……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_c:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8251b24d83e1b566f5e844fbd0f28c715d419881802824f4af30bb73adc1331a",
      "text": "原来如此。\n夏来先生，其实啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_c:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36e49f274830722bf9f0b4663d111c407edafece623228563fb4ada2dc02b2ab",
      "text": "原来这个……是恋爱的提问啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_c:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dec2a98a2bdcdd7997e4143f7b921642639f2e68c678584e55207adeff676b6d",
      "text": "我，不擅长聊恋爱的话题……\n这个回答，不行吗……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_c:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7acb8175fcbfb71b1f7025ad193e767b029b8ba9534507bdbbd169d92b753a51",
      "text": "我想编辑部那边大概是想听听夏来先生关于恋爱的\n看法，不过……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_c:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d50f96e5e98883cb59836aa0b416f5411a81ddfd4c7cce4766f4883cdd48ad5d",
      "text": "我也觉得现在的回答更有夏来先生的风格。我去直接跟编辑部商量一下吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_c:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:28b0af817c107fc610160b0f7d4cbe9986f782dfe768b19b4bb74b287ae85c49",
      "text": "真的吗？谢谢……\n●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
